{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Are you bored enough to work while you are on your free time? Well then, here is the work game you are looking for.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into nice open world barista game where\u2026 bla bla bla. Why would you need open world barista game when you can give customers\u00a0stale espresso and mock them. If you don't like what customer orders; like <strong>&quot;Black tea with extra sugar and vegan milk&quot; </strong>you can just mock it or expel it. But if you be nice to them, they will leave tip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like real life, you have two hands in this game. Even better; you can use your both hands as well as your dominant hand and there are things that require two hands. You can play the game with only\u00a0 your mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't tamp the espresso, it will taste bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is realistic enough to teach someone how to make coffee, but not enough to make it a barista</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655370/extras/db5030cf00d504a40050372950ffd257.webp?t=1770428254\" width=64 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 type of milk</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 type of drink mix</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 type of syrup</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>23 type of coffee recipe base</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655370?t=1770428254","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365537